1
00:00:00,654 --> 00:00:05,594
(Howard:)Space is beautiful, Earth is beautiful.
Same old, same old.

2
00:00:07,127 --> 00:00:08,997
- What's wrong?
- Nothing.

3
00:00:09,162 --> 00:00:11,822
- Everything's fine, heh.
- Howard.

4
00:00:14,801 --> 00:00:17,961
(Howard:)The other astronauts
are being mean to me.

5
00:00:20,674 --> 00:00:22,104
(Bernadette:)No, what are they doing?

6
00:00:22,275 --> 00:00:25,215
(Howard:)Well, like, for instance,
the other day, when I was asleep...

7
00:00:25,378 --> 00:00:27,368
(Howard:)...one of the guys
went on a space-walk...

8
00:00:27,547 --> 00:00:33,487
(Howard:)...and glued a big-eyed rubber alien mask
to the outside of my window.

9
00:00:34,821 --> 00:00:38,021
(Howard:)When I woke up,
I screamed for like nine minutes.

10
00:00:38,825 --> 00:00:40,195
(Bernadette:)Oh, Howie.

11
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,450
(Howard:)You can see it if you want.
It's on YouTube.

12
00:00:42,629 --> 00:00:45,459
Google "Astronaut screams
for nine minutes."

13
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,000
(Bernadette:)Why don't you stand up to them?

14
00:00:49,169 --> 00:00:51,299
(Howard:)What am I supposed to say?

15
00:00:51,771 --> 00:00:53,031
(Penny:)I don't know.

16
00:00:53,206 --> 00:00:55,736
Say, "Being mean is lame.

17
00:00:55,909 --> 00:01:04,019
What's cool is being nice."

